{"availability":"available","full":"arshawnarbabi/ThrowbackGPT","name":"ThrowbackGPT","description":"A nostalgic, faithful recreation of the original Nov-2022 ChatGPT UI, powered by gpt-4o-mini with a GPT-3.5-era persona. Independent project, not affiliated with OpenAI. Demo: throwbackgpt.arshawnarbabi.com","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-27T08:53:31Z","updated":"2026-06-27T09:44:15Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://throwbackgpt.arshawnarbabi.com","topics":["ai","chatbot","chatgpt","gpt-3-5","gpt-4o-mini","llm","nextjs","nostalgia","openai","prompt-engineering","react","recreation","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://throwbackgpt.arshawnarbabi.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:17.868Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:17.868Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:17.868Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:42:17.868Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A faithful, open-source recreation of the original November–December 2022 ChatGPT interface, powered by OpenAI's gpt-4o-mini wearing a researched GPT-3.5 (2022) persona.","This is a fun side project that I thought was interesting and wanted to build. It began as a nostalgia experiment, an attempt to recreate the original launch-day ChatGPT as closely as possible, both the way it looked and the way the old model used to talk. It ended up becoming a faithful, eval-tuned clone of the late-2022 experience. The hosted demo above is the easiest way to try it; you only need to clone or fork the repo if you want to run or modify your own copy."],"features":["Token-by-token streaming with the blinking cursor; Stop generating / Regenerate response","Light + dark themes (default light, like the original — the sidebar stays dark in both, also like the original)","Multi-chat history in the sidebar with inline rename/delete, persiste